{"server":"tw","storyId":"1stact_level_a001_06_beg","groupId":"1stact","stageId":"a001_06","title":"黃金三角","storyCode":"GT-6","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"6fd14363cf1e39b9c33cab0438c67d372400181d1dd8c68627b97f38a06c69a5","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第六关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"幾年之前，我們成了感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"我們躲躲藏藏，平穩的生活一夜之間就變成了奢侈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"原本，我們以為整合運動能使我們的生活有所改觀，可......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"仍舊沒有一家店肯賣給我們麵包，沒有任何地方能容納我們落腳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我和兄弟們離開了那裡，四處流浪，直到聽說了寶藏的消息，來到了這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"只要這次，只要我們能奪下這份寶藏——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"我們就能前往哥倫比亞。雖然那是一片遙遠的土地，但在那裡，感染者還能擁有自己的城鎮和田地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，格拉尼，為了我所有的兄弟，這份寶藏我一定會拿到手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"寶藏不遠了，我知道。你做得很好，但是很遺憾————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"女人！你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別擋路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我不管你們是什麼人，要做什麼事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你們所有人，馬上從我的視線裡消失。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac1_6"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果一定要和你為敵，斯卡蒂......今天我們會死戰到底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"所以這種人就是格拉尼你找來的同伴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"你們拿了寶藏，那滴水村怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎麼樣，他們都還能活下去，我們卻已經無路可走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我認識你沒多久，但我知道你是什麼樣的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"你跟你身邊那個怪物不一樣，你沒把我們感染者當成外人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"(我覺得斯卡蒂也只是一視同仁地把我們全都幹掉而已，她大概也沒把誰當成外人吧......)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"格拉尼，告訴我可蘿爾在哪裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道這些寶藏對我們意味著什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉大鮑勃，我已經接下委託了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"我只有一個任務，就是把這份寶藏交給可蘿爾，幫助她讓村子恢復平靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"別的與我無關，把可蘿爾交給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"那你要那個女孩幹什麼，怪物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"你難道想要剝掉她的皮，喝掉她的血嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"在這之前，你也聽這個小個子說過了，不管怎麼樣，她都不會把村長交給你的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"但我不一樣，我只要寶藏。我根本不會傷害她！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我真的受夠了......格拉尼，可蘿爾在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"可蘿爾只是想保護這個村子。她其實也不在乎寶藏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"那就把寶藏給我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動和賞金獵人也沒什麼不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"我跟你們賞金獵人不是一路人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾經也是斯卡蒂你這樣的混蛋，但現在我全都看清楚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"眼下這個世道，什麼財富，地位，都是狗屁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只想靠那筆寶藏活下去，僅此而已！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我再說一遍，把可蘿爾給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"無論是可蘿爾還是寶藏，我都不會交給你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"這可是我的委託。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"格拉尼！你還有機會！我不想和你打這場對誰都沒好處的架！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"我只要拿到寶藏，誰都不會吃苦頭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"這份寶藏裡本來就有你那一份，大鮑勃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"我還有我的兄弟們！我要先見到寶藏再說！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"如果要用武力的話，我們之間的差距，你們自己心裡明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然沒什麼自信，但如果要同時和你們開戰，我能做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"至少我們之間的問題是可以解決的，格拉尼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們就先解決她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"說完了沒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"如果在這裡開戰，就真的沒有回頭路可走了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"我們————"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"格拉尼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，我找到了！我找到寶藏了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"我好不容易都把整箱都拖出———"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"鮑勃先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"你平安無事就——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"別過來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘖！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"我們......早就沒有回頭路了!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"誒？可蘿爾！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"斯卡蒂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼要用這種沒有威力的爆破物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"還給她的人情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來，就要用真的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"斯卡蒂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"你不關心寶藏。而且，你也不想傷害可蘿爾小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"否則，在爆炸的那一瞬間，你就會出手擄走她並搶走寶藏，而不是保護她了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我不要寶藏。我要的答案在可蘿爾身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"早說出來不就好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"說實話，裝壞人也很累吧？坦率一點不好嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想讓其他人捲進我的......任務裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"但這次的任務目標對我而言，真的很重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"那當然，我知道。雖然我們任務不同，但方向是一致的不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"幫助其他幹員完成任務，是理所當然的吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"只能用武力來裁定寶藏的歸屬了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"斯卡蒂，下手一定要輕一點，輕一點哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"格 拉 尼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"鮑勃大叔，抱歉，可能會有點疼！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_220_grani","aliases":["格拉尼"]},{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["斯卡蒂"]}]}
